\ Fixture for own_module_image_scan_unknown. `a-quot` hands out a stored
\ quotation whose bare `b-only` is outside this module's scope: never
\ defined here, never imported. The nested definition keeps the quotation
\ uncompilable, so the `b-only` call resolves at runtime inside the image
\ under this module's stamp; a compilable inner quotation would instead get
\ a freeze-baked call and never reach runtime resolution.

a-quot: ( -- q ) [ [ inner: [ 0 ] ; inner drop b-only ] ] ;

a-tag: ( -- str ) [ "A-TAG" ] ;
